    <string name="help_section_faq">Common questions</string>
    <string name="help_faq_1_question">How do I add a game to my library?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_1_answer">Search for a game using the search bar, open its detail page, and tap "Add to library". You can then set a status like playing, completed, or backlog.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_2_question">Can I track my playtime?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_2_answer">Yes! Open any game in your library and edit its details. You can log hours played, start and finish dates, and even write a short review.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_3_question">How do I connect with friends?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_3_answer">Visit another user\'s profile and send them a friend request. Once accepted, you\'ll see their activity in your feed and can message them directly.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_4_question">Is my data private?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_4_answer">By default your profile is public, but you can change its visibility in Settings. Your library, stats, and activity respect your privacy preferences.</string>

